      "text": "None of these",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Relation <math><mi>R</mi></math> is reflexive, since <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo></math> real number <math><mi>a</mi></math>.</p><p>It is symmetric, since <math><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br />However,&nbsp;<math><mi>R</mi></math> is not transitive.&nbsp;</p><p>Consider three real numbers&nbsp;<math><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> and <math><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math> . We have<br /><math><mtext>2</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />and <math><mtext>2</mtext><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />So, <math><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>R</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />But,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mi>R</mi></menclose><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> since <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8815;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
